1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. Bb5+ Bd7 4. Bxd7+ Nxd7 5. O-O Ngf6 6. Re1 (6. Qe2 Z0 7.
c3 $140 Z0 8. d4 $140 Z0 9. e5 $140 Z0 10. Rd1 $140) 6... e6 7. d4 cxd4 8. Qxd4
Be7 9. c4 O-O 10. Nc3 a6 11. Bg5 {The B is better placed on the a1-h8 diagonal.
} (11. b3 Z0 12. Bb2) 11... Qc7 12. Rac1 Rac8 13. b3 Rfe8 14. h3 Qb8 15. a4 $2
{Creates a serious weakness on the b3square.} (15. Qd3 Nc5 16. Qf1 {leaves
White with a minute advantage.}) 15... Nc5 16. Nd2 h6 17. Bh4 e5 18. Qe3 Nfxe4
19. Bxe7 Nxd2 20. Nd5 Ndxb3 21. Rc3 Nd4 22. Bf6 Re6 23. Qg3 g6 24. h4 Nd7 25.
Ne7+ Kh7 26. h5 Rxf6 27. hxg6+ fxg6 28. Qg4 Re8 29. Nd5 Rf5 30. Rg3 Re6 31.
Qxd4 exd4 32. Rxe6 Nf8 33. Re7+ Kh8 34. Rh3 Qd8 35. Rxb7 h5 36. f4 Qa5 37. Rhb3
Qc5 38. Rc7 Rxd5 39. Rxc5 Rxc5 40. Rb6 Rxc4 41. Rxa6 d5 42. Kf2 d3 43. Ke3 Rxf4
